  "title": "Legora is acquiring Wexler to bring fact intelligence to agentic legal work",
  "summary": "Legora today announced that it is acquiring London-based Wexler, the fact intelligence platform that extracts, verifies, and reasons over the factual record from large and unstructured document sets, used by some of the world's leading litigation and disputes teams at Clifford Chance, Goodwin, and Herbert Smith Freehills Kramer, as well as in-house legal and compliance teams at large global enterprises. Wexler's engineering team will form the founding team of Legora's London engineering hub.",
